### Hypertube API - manual request collection (VSCode REST Client extension)
### Run with the "Send Request" link that appears above each ### block.
### Full endpoint reference: http://localhost:3000/api-docs (Swagger UI)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Register (public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "username": "ada",
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "password": "str0ng-p4ss-phrase"
}

### Login (public) - captures the token for the requests below
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "str0ng-p4ss-phrase"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### List users (protected - needs the token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one user (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update own profile (protected + ownership: 403 on another id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada K."
}

### Add requests below as endpoints land (reset password, movies, comments...).
